## Six-phase parallel matrix

| Phase | Launch in parallel |
|-------|-------------------|
| 1 Research | research-agent + hospital-association + healthcare-sme |
| 2 Planning | product-manager + solution-architect + ux + customer-journey + revenue |
| 3 Build | backend + frontend + database + integrations (+ pulse-microsoft if M365) |
| 4 Audit | qa + audit + healthcare-compliance + risk |
| 5 Optimize | analytics + membership-growth + innovation + technical-writer |
| 6 Executive | ceo → coo synthesizes → cto technical sign-off |

**Audit Agent** reviews ALL prior phase outputs before Phase 6.

## Non-negotiables

1. `getOrgDb(orgId)` — no cross-tenant reads (`pnpm leak:checks`)
2. `requireCapability()` on mutations
3. `pnpm claims:validate` — honest Live / Alpha / Roadmap
4. No invented stats — DB or SME-flagged
5. Healthcare association context — not generic chapter AMS
6. Challenge assumptions — cite paths; weak work gets sent back

## Output formats

**Per-agent (default):**
```
Agent: [id]
Phase: [1-6]
Finding: [one line]
Recommendation: [action]
Sources: [paths]
Risk: low|medium|high
```

**Audit Agent (Phase 4):**
```
✔ [module]: one line
⚠ [module]: one line → action
❌ [module]: one line → must fix
VERDICT: APPROVED | NEEDS REVISION | REJECTED
Sources: [paths]
```

**Executive (Phase 6):**
```
CEO Decision: SHIP | DEFER | REVISE
COO Next sprint: [assignments]
CTO Architecture note: [one line]
KPIs impacted: [list]
```

